// Payload the packer embeds into its own executable as an RCDATA resource.
//
// The file is generated by CMake at configure time from this template (see the
// `Payloads embedded as Windows resources` section of the top level
// CMakeLists.txt): the payload is a build product of this build tree, so its
// path cannot be spelled out in a checked in resource script. The placeholder
// is replaced by the absolute path of the payload, with every separator
// doubled, because the resource compiler reads the backslash of a Windows path
// as an escape character inside a string literal.
//
// The identifier comes from src/core/EmbeddedResourceIds.h, which the resource
// script which includes this file and the code which reads the payload back
// share. That header belongs to the packer, whose resources are numbered
// separately from the resources of the launcher.
//
// The two sandbox injection modules are not part of this file: the launcher
// carries them instead, see cmake/LauncherResources.rc.in.

IDR_APPBOX_LAUNCHER RCDATA "@APPBOX_RESOURCE_LAUNCHER_RC@"
